      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload your own static textured GLB and matching RGB face photo in nodes 1 and 2. No sample assets are bundled.\n\nAdjust strength, feather, render_resolution and yaw in node 3. Queue, inspect the comparison and native 3D viewer, then save.\n\nTexture projection preserves geometry but partitions original triangles into body/face primitives. It cannot repair silhouette or hidden anatomy. SaveGLB writes 3d/GLBFaceRetexture_*.glb."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Upload your own static textured GLB and matching RGB face photo in nodes 1 and 2. No sample assets are bundled.\n\nAdjust strength, feather, render_resolution and yaw in node 3. Queue, inspect the comparison and native 3D viewer, then save.\n\nTexture projection preserves geometry but partitions original triangles into body/face primitives. It cannot repair silhouette or hidden anatomy. SaveGLB writes 3d/GLBFaceRetexture_*.glb."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "title": "READ ME · Texture projection, not geometry repair"
